 ## SCENARIO-EBT-3731-FLAGGED: Flagged Upstream Artifacts Are Excluded
 Given any Exp 3724 through Exp 3730 source artifact carries `flagged_adversarial=true`, the capstone records that experiment in `flagged_artifacts_excluded` and excludes it from headline aggregation and unflagged citation fields rather than laundering it into the milestone outcome.
+
+## REQ-EBT-3742: V342 Thesis-A Recovery Capstone Aggregation
+The system must provide `scripts/experiment_3742_capstone_v342.py` to aggregate checked-in Exp 3732 through Exp 3741 artifacts into `results/experiment_3742_capstone_v342.json`. The capstone must read upstream JSON only, exclude any artifact carrying `flagged_adversarial=true` from headline aggregation, cite unflagged upstream artifacts with imported fields and SHA256 hashes, record missing upstream artifacts without fabricating their results, avoid live-model markers in the capstone itself, and pass `scripts/adversarial_verify.py` without a critical flag. The artifact must include the required principle-annotated fields for the terminal verdict, false-negative correction, genuine part-(a) outcome, part-(b) outcome, matched-compute win boolean, paper-ready preservation, frozen-headline preservation, flagged exclusions, upstream citations, random seed, checksum, and duration.
+
+The capstone must state the .342 Thesis-A result plainly and narrowly: Exp 3733 corrected the .341 infrastructure false-negative; Exp 3734/3735 fixed the harness and trained only the real tiny EBT/matched AR evidence actually recorded; Exp 3736 supersedes Exp 3729 and decides part-(a) as stable-green-light, genuinely-bounded, or untested; Exp 3737, Exp 3738, and Exp 3739 may support part-(b) only when part-(a) green-lights; Exp 3740 and Exp 3741 are carried as FR-11 and KV260 continuity evidence. The capstone must preserve `paper_ready=true`, frozen FoVer `0.9131`, and the P0.1 / energy-SELECTION honest-negative-bounded invariant, and must not turn a part-(a) green-light into a scale claim or a part-(b) tiny-scale win into an at-scale generator claim.
+
+## SCENARIO-EBT-3742-UNTESTED: Part-A Not Green-Lit Keeps Part-B Not-Run
+Given Exp 3733 records the .341 kill-gate as an infrastructure false-negative, Exp 3734 records a fixed harness with nonzero tiny EBT and matched AR training, Exp 3735 is blocked before completing the resume, Exp 3736 records `green_light_342=false` because training did not complete, Exp 3737 is gate-blocked, Exp 3738 is absent, and Exp 3739 records `part_b_not_run`, the capstone writes a terminal verdict ending in `part_a_untested_part_b_not_run_paper_ready_true_frozen_headline_unchanged`, sets `thesis_a_part_a_outcome=untested`, sets `thesis_a_part_b_outcome=not-run`, sets `ebt_beats_ar_at_matched_compute=false`, preserves the paper-ready, frozen-headline, and P0.1 invariants, cites only unflagged existing upstream artifacts, records Exp 3738 as missing, and makes no live inference claim.
+
+## SCENARIO-EBT-3742-FLAGGED: Flagged Upstream Sources Are Quarantined
+Given any Exp 3732 through Exp 3741 source artifact carries `flagged_adversarial=true`, the capstone records that artifact in `flagged_artifacts_excluded` and excludes it from headline aggregation and citation fields rather than laundering it into the .342 thesis outcome.
